<h2 style="margin: 0 0 4px; color: #111827; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">
  Welcome aboard, <%= name %>!
</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 28px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">Your account is now active</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #374151; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
  Your email has been verified and your <strong><%= appName %></strong> account is fully active.
</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 28px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 24px;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; color: #111827; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">
        Here is what you can do next:
      </p>
      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
            &#10003;&nbsp; Log in to your account
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
            &#10003;&nbsp; Explore all features
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
  If you have any questions, our support team is always happy to help.
</p>
